sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthMiddleware
    participant SessionStore
    participant UserStore
    participant ABACMiddleware
    participant Handler

    Client->>AuthMiddleware: Request + Token
    AuthMiddleware->>AuthMiddleware: Extract token
    AuthMiddleware->>SessionStore: Validate session
    SessionStore-->>AuthMiddleware: Session data

    alt Valid session
        AuthMiddleware->>UserStore: Get user
        UserStore-->>AuthMiddleware: User
        AuthMiddleware->>AuthMiddleware: Create AuthContext
        AuthMiddleware->>ABACMiddleware: Request + AuthContext

        ABACMiddleware->>ABACMiddleware: Check required roles
        ABACMiddleware->>ABACMiddleware: Check resource ownership
        ABACMiddleware->>ABACMiddleware: Check org membership

        alt Authorized
            ABACMiddleware-->>Handler: Request + AuthContext
            Handler-->>Client: Response
        else Unauthorized
            ABACMiddleware-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
        end

    else Invalid/missing session
        AuthMiddleware-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end